What this is
  This directory contains a proprietary MLB bat-tracking analytics system: original
  analytical models and the tooling that serves them — Swing+ (bat-path quality),
  Decision+ (swing/take run value), the Bat-to-Ball+ integration, and Hitter+ (the
  OPS-optimal three-axis blend), plus the FastAPI single-page application, per-pitch
  swing grading, hitter-vs-pitcher matchup engine, aging projections, and model audit
  report cards. The source files, documentation, data pipelines, and derived metrics
  are the author's intellectual property.

